{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"Uber向運輸署遞交網約車服務牌照申請\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/UBER-APPLY-261029-15.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】網約車平台Uber表示，已正式向運輸署遞交網約車服務牌照申請。</p><p>網約車牌照申請周五截止。Uber表示，已按照運輸署要求遞交相關申請表格及文件，將會與政府保持溝通，全力配合牌照申請，又指支持政府推出網約車服務規管制度，已擴大支援團隊，為相關司機提供培訓及筆試準備，協助司機順利過渡新規管。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:42:13.286693+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:09:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:38:14.935386+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:38:20.898908+00:00","content_hash":"7efd0c1c700063139d4b63e7995c87c69f9e1ed41b2097bb7d73ac13a5f75827","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:42:13.286693+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}